        <h2>Caring Machines Symposium</h2>
        <p>I was an invited speaker in an international symposium held in the Bayes Center, Edinburgh, to discuss on creating novel technologies that promote responsible research and innovation for AI and robotics in the health and care sectors. The symposium was followed by a workshop focused on the same topic.</p>
